flowchart LR
 Source[Source Record/Events] --> Contract[Schema/Data Contract]
 Contract --> Pipeline[Versioned Pipeline/Transformation]
 Pipeline --> Quality[Quality Checks]
 Quality --> Recon[Reconciliation]
 Recon --> Dataset[Certified Dataset]
 Dataset --> Metric[Certified Metric]
 Metric --> Report[Report/Dashboard]
 Source -.lineage.-> Dataset
 Dataset -.lineage.-> Metric
 Metric -.lineage.-> Report
 Quality --> Incident[Analytics Incident if blocking]
 Recon --> Incident
